            "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Yes, indeed, it might. Thanks for sharing!\r\n\r\nOne extra observation here is that having cursor position shown in statusline can be a valid way to simultaneously test cursor position with screenshot. So maybe setting 'statusline' to `%l, %v` is worth here (with default `laststatus=2`, of course).",
            "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Yes, indeed, it might. Thanks for sharing!</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">One extra observation here is that having cursor position shown in statusline can be a valid way to simultaneously test cursor position with screenshot. So maybe setting 'statusline' to <code class=\"notranslate\">%l, %v</code> is worth here (with default <code class=\"notranslate\">laststatus=2</code>, of course).</p>",
